        "text_copy_copy488896_691140162": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "courtney.dickens@stryker.com",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Neuroform Atlas<sup>® </sup>Stent System<br>\n</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Easy to use. Easy to deploy.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>The Neuroform Atlas Stent System is designed to provide enhanced conformability, stability, and ease of use. The unique adaptive cell design provides the coil support and wall apposition needed to perform safe and effective stent-assisted coiling procedures.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 05 2025 14:27:23 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
